[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Don't be So Sure!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.66]Lesson 131 | 第131课
[00:03.36]Don't be so sure! | 别那么肯定!
[00:07.28]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:13.03]What's the problem about deciding on a holiday? | 决定度假地点有什么问题?
[00:19.70]Where are you going to spend your holidays this year, Gary? | 加里,你们今年打算去哪里度假?
[00:25.84]We may go abroad. | 我们可能出国。
[00:28.60]I'm not sure. | 我还不确定。
[00:30.97]My wife wants to go to Egypt. | 我妻子想去埃及。
[00:34.66]I'd like to go there, too. | 我也想去那儿。
[00:37.93]We can't make up our minds. | 我们做不了决定。
[00:41.88]Will you travel by sea or by air? | 你们将坐船还是坐飞机?
[00:46.03]We may travel by sea. | 我们可以坐船去。
[00:49.34]It's cheaper, isn't it? | 这样更便宜,不是吗?
[00:51.76]It may be cheaper, but it takes a long time. | 可能是更便宜,但要花很长时间。
[00:57.18]I'm sure you'll enjoy yourselves. | 我确信你们会玩得开心的。
[01:00.28]Don't be so sure. | 别那么肯定。
[01:02.35]We might not go anywhere. | 我们可能哪儿也不去。
[01:05.11]My wife always worries too much. | 我妻子总是担心太多。
[01:09.05]Who's going to look after the dog? | 谁来照看狗?
[01:12.53]Who's going to look after the house? | 谁来照看房子?
[01:16.08]Who's going to look after the garden? | 谁来照看花园?
[01:19.66]We have this problem every year. | 我们每年都有这个问题。
[01:23.11]In the end, we stay at home and look after everything! | 最后,我们待在家里,照看一切!